DESCRIPTION:Join Us for an Evening Under the Stars! \n\nCome explore the wo
 nders of the night sky with us at Medoc Mountain State Park on November 13
 th at 6:30 PM for our monthly Astronomy Night!\n\nWe'll have our large tel
 escope set up and ready for you to enjoy breathtaking views of distant gal
 axies\, sparkling star clusters\, and beautiful nebulae. Whether you're a 
 longtime astronomy enthusiast or simply curious about what's up in the nig
 ht sky\, everyone is welcome!\n\nA few things to remember:\n\n Please brin
 g a red-light flashlight to help preserve everyone's night vision. Dress a
 ppropriately for the weather\, as we'll be spending time outdoors.Weather 
 Notice: This event is weather-dependent and may be canceled due to incleme
 nt conditions. If the weather looks questionable\, please call the park of
 fice for the latest updates before heading out.\n\nWe look forward to shar
 ing a beautiful night under the stars with you!
GEO:36.263694;-77.888686
LOCATION:Medoc Mountain State Park
SUMMARY:Astronomy Event
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/astronomy-event-210
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
CATEGORIES:Nature & Wildlife Programs
END:VEVENT
