BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_newhopeaudubon
SUMMARY:NHBA Bird Outing
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T110000
DTSTAMP:20261114T061623Z
UID:49r0ci82flrc8drkcriamccqdk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T080000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261027T173644Z
DESCRIPTION:Contact Claire Cote at <a href="mailto:clairemccote@gmail.com"
 >clairemccote@gmail.com</a> with questions. The location will be Mason Fa
 rm Biological Preserve in Chapel Hill\, located behind the Finley Golf Cou
 rse at 500 Finley Golf Course Rd.\, Chapel Hill. <br><br>Going south on U
 S 15-501\, turn left onto Old Mason Farm Rd. at the stop light. After abou
 t a mile\, turn right at the entrance to Finley and drive around the back 
 of the clubhouse to the parking lot. Drive through the parking lot and con
 tinue onto a paved road at the back\, right-hand corner of the lot. Follow
  this road about 100 feet (just past the practice putting green) until you
  come to a fork in the road and take the right-hand fork onto a gravel roa
 d. Go about 0.5 miles until you come to a junction. Turn right to cross a 
 concrete low water crossing across Morgan Creek. Go over the low water cro
 ssing and up the embankment to meet in the parking lot. <br><br>Heavy rai
 ns prior to the event may make the low water crossing impassible and resul
 t in a location change.<br><br>This outing is sponsored by the New Hope Bi
 rd Alliance (formerly New Hope Audubon).<br><br>Outings usually last 2-3 h
 ours. No reservations or sign-up needed. If there is a large turnout for a
 ny particular outing\, we may split into two groups. We do recommend carpo
 oling for families or friend pods\; while we love pets\, there is a ‘no-
 pet’ policy for bird outings. New birders and birders of all skill level
 s are welcome. <br><br>Please wear long pants\, socks\, and sturdy shoes 
 (ticks and chiggers may be present). Sun and bug protection are also recom
 mended. Bring snacks and water if you like. Heavy rain will result in canc
 ellation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T145657Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:New Hope Bird Alliance
END:VEVENT
