SUMMARY:Red Leather Tahoe Tour
DESCRIPTION:Red Leather is an anonymous alternative rock\, folk-rock\, and country-rock singer-songwriter and guitarist originally from Reno\, Nevada\, and based in Los Angeles. He performs and appears wearing a signature red cowboy hat with tassels/fringes that conceals his face\, and he has not revealed his legal name or age to the public. His music frequently draws from his past struggles with substance addiction and personal redemption.
