DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate A250 with us by unlocking clues from the region'
 s history here at Merchants Millpond!  We have designed an escape room wit
 h a series of puzzles and riddles that lead you through the history of the
  region and NC State Parks. You will have 1 hour to solve the clues to cre
 ate a timeline of the area's history and secure the key to escape. Registr
 ation is required. To sign up for a day and time please call 252-357-1191.
   Gather your friends or family (max. 10 people) if you are up for the cha
 llenge.
