DESCRIPTION:Join us for a candid conversation with Representative Zack Haw
 kins and Senator Natalie Murdock. They’ll look back on the short session
  in Raleigh and tell us what they’re focused on heading into the long se
 ssion. We’ll talk about what passed\, what didn’t\, and what it means 
 for Durham businesses\, especially for economic development\, business gro
 wth and where our region goes from here. Chamber leadership will moderate\
 , and then we’ll open the floor so you can ask your own questions.
