DESCRIPTION:November 16\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m.\, Daughters of the American R
 evolution and the Sons of the American Revolution are bringing this celebr
 ation right to New Bern\, North Carolina's Union Point Park.\n\nThe Richar
 d Dobbs Spaight Chapter NSDAR and the New Bern Chapter of the Sons of the 
 American Revolution are teaming up to recreate this powerful piece of hist
 ory. You will hear the full\, thrilling story\, witness a live cannon firi
 ng from a real Coast Guard vessel\, and experience a live tactical respons
 e from the SAR Musket Team.\n\nClear your schedule for November 16th at 1:
 00 p.m. and come out to the New Bern Union Point Park\, experience the sig
 hts and sounds of the Revolution\, and help us celebrate the day America w
 as first recognized by the world. See you there!
