DESCRIPTION:AI for Research\n\nThis month the TraCS Data Science Lab (TDSL)
  will continue its update to the current state of approachable AI tools an
 d resources for research.\n\n \n\nSpeaker:\nPeter Leese\, MSPH\nDirector\,
  TraCS Data Science Lab\n\n \n\nRegister for the Zoom\n\n \n\nSeminars in 
 the NC TraCS Data Science Lab Seminar Series cover a range of topics relat
 ed to health care data science\, clinical data\, data engineering\, and wo
 rking in these areas at UNC-Chapel Hill. These hybrid seminars are usually
  held monthly on the third Tuesday of each month from 12:30-1:30 p.m. in t
 he NC TraCS suite (room 219) on the 2nd floor of Brinkhous-Bullitt or via 
 Zoom.
