DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Fields and uncover the story behind the tragic even
 t that occurred on the foggy morning of May 21st\, 1963. While many people
  try to attempt this trek solo or unguided\, now is a chance to do so in a
  safer manner. This will be a challenging hike with semi-steep inclines an
 d thick understory. Recommended for the experienced hiker. Space is limite
 d. To register for this program\, email Jacob.fields@ncparks.gov.
