DESCRIPTION:<span><p>Come join Engaged Defenders for Democracy as we meet 
 on Wednesdays from 3:30-5pm at American Tobacco Trail Bridge over I-40. Lo
 cation: AMC Streets of Southpoint 8030 Renaissance Pkwy Durham\, NC 27713.
  Parking lots are behind Southpoint Mall near the AMC theater or in the pa
 rking lot of Roses lot on Hwy 54. Go behind Southpoint Mall to the AMC the
 ater parking lot. Walk towards Hwy 40 and look for entrance to the trail. 
 It is a 4-minute walk. You also can park at Rose's\, 105 W NC. Hwy 54 2771
 3. The walk to the bridge from Roses is a 4-minute walk.</p><p>We will hav
 e a big sign. If you bring signs\, please make sure they are positive and 
 show what we are fighting for: "Freedom 4 All" "Protect Free Speech." Plea
 se bring American flags to wave as well.</p><p>See you there every Wednesd
 ay! Thanks activism warriors!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </spa
 n><a href="https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-demo
 cracy">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democrac
 y</a></p><p>For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://
 www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/enga
 gedefendersfordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engage
 defendersfordemocracy/event/842871/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefende
 rsfordemocracy/event/842871/</a> </p></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T223122Z
LOCATION:AMC Streets of Southpoint 8030 Renaissance Pkwy\, 8030 Renaissanc
 e Pkwy\, Durham\, NC\, 27713
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncwf": "https://ncwf.org/event/squawk-rattle-and-howl-columbia/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncwf
X-SOURCE:NC Wildlife Federation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261118T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261118T170000
DTSTAMP:20261109T155840Z
CREATED:20261109T155839Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T155840Z
UID:10001859-1795015800-1795021200@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:Squawk\, Rattle\, and Howl! (Columbia)
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered what animal is making the interesting sound you’re hearing outside? Join NCWF\, Pocosin Lakes National Wildlife Refuge\, and Pocosin Arts School of Fine Craft as we explore the variety of wildlife noises one might hear while enjoying nature in northeastern NC. Inspired by the unique species and sounds we’ll learn about\, youth and adult participants alike will have the opportunity to create their own handmade instruments out of clay! \nPieces will need to be fired back at the studio so participants will be able to pick up their clay instruments at the next art and nature collaboration on Wednesday\, December 9th. \nRegistration is required for this free program. Please reserve your spot at https://pocosinarts.org/event/squawk-rattle-howl/.
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/squawk-rattle-and-howl-columbia/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
