 meetings. Your deliverables are due\, and you're overwhelmed. This worksho
 p fixes that. In under 90 minutes\, you'll build a real\, working AI agent
 \, from scratch\, no coding required\, that reads every email\, sorts it i
 nto categories\, and tells you exactly what needs your attention first.\n\
 n \n\nEvery morning. Automatically. Done. Not a demo\, not a concept\, a l
 ive agent you build yourself and take home today. This is what it means to
  become Fluid-Shaped™: instead of doing everything yourself\, you learn 
 to summon exactly the help you need\, the moment you need it. Think of it 
 as hiring your first AI employee\, then meeting the rest of the team you c
 ould hire/build next: an AI Chief of Staff and a bench of specialized advi
 sors for Growth\, Sales\, Product\, and Strategy. Sponsored by Innovate Ca
 rolina
