SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260515T165008Z
DESCRIPTION:<b><b> </b></b>Come One Come All...To The Trancestors Kiki Bal
 l. <br><br>This year we're honoring Trans Day of Remembrance (TDOR) with 
 an emphasis on the celebration of Queer and Trans Life. This Ball will fea
 ture categories ranging from performance\, face\, realness and runway for 
 a total of $3500 in Grand Prize Cash disbursed....all in remembrance of ou
 r fallen Trans community members.<br><br>This will be a fully catered even
 t with bites from ChopHouse BBQ and there will be a cash bar. Complimentar
 y valet parking is being offered to the first 200 people and complimentary
  coat check is also being offered to the first 50 arrivals.<br><br>Door en
 try is $15 and table purchases are $50 while tables last. (A table purchas
 e includes 2 tickets for entry and seats 8).<br><br>This event is hosted b
 y The LGBTQ Center of Durham with support from The Black LGBTQ Migrant Pro
 ject (BLMP)\, Southerners on New Ground (SONG)\, The Transgender Law Cente
 r (TLC)\, and the Transgender Education Network of Texas (TENT)
