DESCRIPTION:Join us for a historic milestone as the Jacksonville Christmas 
 Holiday Parade returns with a powerful new theme for the semiquincentennia
 l: A Star Spangled Christmas: Celebrating 250 Years of America\, presented
  by Marine Federal Credit Union.\n\nThis cherished community event by the 
 Jacksonville Onslow Chamber of Commerce\, is a patriotic tribute to 250 ye
 ars of American spirit\, resilience\, and community.\n\nThe parade route b
 egins at Coastal Carolina Community College and ends at Brynn Marr Shoppin
 g Center.\n\nWe are thrilled to announce astronaut Christina Koch as this 
 year’s Parade Grand Marshal!\n\nRegistration for the 2026 Jacksonville C
 hristmas Holiday Parade is now open!
LOCATION:The parade route begins at Coastal Carolina Community College and 
 ends at Brynn Marr Shopping Center.
SUMMARY:A Star Spangled Christmas: Celebrating 250 Years of America
