DESCRIPTION:Join us for a family friendly trail workday along the Hickory N
 ut Falls Trail. Activities will include loosening blazes on trees to allow
  for tree growth\, replacing damaged blazes\, and light trail work. We pla
 n to hike 1.4 miles\, to the waterfall and back to the trailhead\, working
  along the way. We will carry our owns supplies. No experience is required
  and all materials will be provided. Please wear close-toed shoes and prop
 er attire. Please bring plenty of water and snacks.  \n\nNovember 21st 2:3
 0pm-4:30pm\n\nMeet in front of Cliff Dwellers Gift Shop\n\n***Admission to
  Chimney Rock Attraction will be waived for volunteers who sign-up in adva
 nce by end of day on November 19th To sign-up\, email Ranger Townsend at: 
 robert.townsend@ncparks.gov***
