DTSTART:20261121T230000Z
DTEND:20261122T043000Z
DESCRIPTION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center is proud to present Jup
 iter Ball\, an evening of celebration and philanthropy as Morehead prepare
 s to embark on a transformative new chapter.\n\n \n\nFor more than 75 year
 s\, Morehead has inspired generations of North Carolinians to look up\, as
 k questions\, and imagine what’s possible. Jupiter Ball brings our commu
 nity together to celebrate that legacy and fuel the next chapter of Morehe
 ad’s mission—ensuring that the wonder of science and the power of curi
 osity remain accessible to all\, for generations to come.\n\n \n\nProceeds
  from the Jupiter Ball will provide for scholarships\, grants\, and access
 ible admission pricing for students and schools from across the state\, en
 suring Morehead truly remains North Carolina’s planetarium.
GEO:35.913753;-79.050409
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center
SUMMARY:Jupiter Ball: A Cosmic Playground
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/jupiter-ball-a-cosmic-playgrou
 nd
