DESCRIPTION:MOORE​​SVILLE FINE ARTS FESTIVAL\nSaturday\, November 21 | 
 10AM–5PM\nSunday\, November 22 | 12PM–4PM\n\nCharles Mack Citizen Cent
 er\n215 N. Main Street\, Mooresville\n\nDiscover original artwork from 50+
  local and regional artists featuring paintings\, pottery\, photography\, 
 jewelry\, woodwork\, fiber art\, and more! Meet the artists\, shop one-of-
 a-kind creations\, and get a head start on your holiday gift-giving.\n\nDo
 wntown Mooresville will be dressed for the holidays\, making it the perfec
 t weekend to shop\, explore\, and enjoy the festive atmosphere!\n\nSomethi
 ng for Everyone!\n\nKids' coloring activities and face painting by Kortney
