SUMMARY:*VIRTUAL* SF/F Group
DESCRIPTION:Durham Writers Group\n**Zoom Info Below Description**\n\nThis 
 sub-group focuses on Science Fiction and Fantasy\, so if you have anything
  that falls under that category — be it short story\, poem\, novel-in-pr
 ogress or screenplay — then come! We'd love to hear from you.\n\nOur for
 mat allows each reader 15 minutes to present their work... followed by app
 roximately 20 minutes of feedback from the other attendees. To ensure a fa
 ir opportunity to respond\, each attendee is limited to 1 minute of feedba
 ck time. (We usually get through three readers.)\n\nIf a reader elects to 
 post their work in advance (NOT a requirement!)\, members will be able to 
 access that work at our Google Group:\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/forum/d
 urham-sff-writers-group\n\nWe ask all members to provide a warning\, both 
 on the Google Group and during the meeting\, if their story features conte
 nt that some readers might find upsetting. This includes descriptions of s
 exual violence.\n\nReaders are:\n• John\n• Carson\n• Naveed\n\nBacku
 p Readers are:\n• Sigma\n• Milbre\n• Raj\n\nDeep Backup: Allegra\n\n
 ***\n\n***We meet every Tuesday at the same time\, but alternate between m
 eeting In-Person and on Zoom. Members may attend both formats\, if desired
 \, but readers will be listed separately under the In-Person or Zoom weeks
 .***\n\n> Enabled for both audio and video. Users can choose what to share
 .\n> Users can share their screen/application\, which could be good for re
 ading along.\n> There is a shareable whiteboard.\n> Users can annotate the
  screen.\n> You can set up polls (host only?).\n\nJoin Zoom Meeting\n[http
 s://us02web.zoom.us/j/81691827858?pwd=klZQya0UmbCjYHPnjbiTV3uIPS5ulg.1](ht
 tps://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fus02web.zoom.us%2Fj%2F81691827858
 %3Fpwd%3DklZQya0UmbCjYHPnjbiTV3uIPS5ulg.1&sa=D&source=calendar&ust=1777911
 660000000&usg=AOvVaw0K3t6Pl7xCXBU6EwFwranp)\n\nMeeting ID: 816 9182 7858\n
 Passcode: 004234\n\nDial by your location\n+13017158592\,\,81691827858#\,\
 ,\,\,\\*004234# US (Washington DC)\n\n+13052241968\,\,81691827858#\,\,\,\,
 \\*004234# US\n\nJoin by SIP\n• [81691827858@zoomcrc.com](mailto:8169182
 7858@zoomcrc.com)\n\nJoin by H.323\n162.255.36.11 (US East)
