UID:05t31ogtqk9evqicfti0habd7m_R20260901T213000@google.com__20261201
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260803T141001Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>This event is intended for Queer and/or Trans survivors:</b
 ><br><br>Some of the biggest barriers to survivor safety are finance relat
 ed. While we do our best to put cash directly into survivors hands\, in ta
 ndem\, we thought it would be awesome to create a body doubling/coworking 
 space where we can support each other in sifting through all the shit that
  goes into getting financial stable. And offer relevant financial resource
 s as we find them!<br><br>That’s why we host our “Get Shit Done” eve
 nings. They will occur the 1st &amp\; 3rd Tuesday of each month and be ava
 ilable in person or online (must <a href="https://forms.gle/oJrgDoueQ6wCXK
 u16" target="_blank">register </a>or email <a href="mailto:advocate@lgbtqc
 enterofdurham.org" target="_blank">advocate@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org</a> fo
 r the virtual link). <br><br>If you or someone you know is a money expert
  who wants to share their knowledge with queer/trans survivors\, please re
 ach out!
LAST-MODIFIED:20261103T195554Z
LOCATION:114 - living room
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
