 o breathe\, play bingo and talk about what went right this semester in the
  African American Cultural Center Library with Embedded Counselor CeErra D
 avis.\n\nEach square on the bingo cards will be a prompt to share somethin
 g\, such as a win you’re proud of\, a song that lifts your mood or someo
 ne you appreciate. Find a neighbor\, share your answer and mark the prompt
  off your card.\n\nWe’ll also discuss how to take care of yourself when 
