 r AI Unfiltered\, a monthly gathering where students\, faculty\, staff\, a
 nd community members come together over coffee to explore the fast-moving 
 world of artificial intelligence. This month\, we'll be offering short AI-
 focused presentations followed by networking.\n\n \n\nWhether you're deepl
 y involved in AI or simply curious about the latest ideas\, this is a welc
 oming space to share insights\, ask questions\, network\, and connect thro
 ugh conversation about all things AI.\n\n \n\nThis event is Sponsored by I
 nnovate Carolina
