DESCRIPTION:Organizations are investing in benefits to improve employee wel
 l-being and taking on initiatives to foster a culture of well-being in the
  workplace. However\, many employees still feel that their job is an obsta
 cle to their well-being rather than a help. What can you do as a manager t
 o shift that perception?\nThis session will discuss practical ways to show
  employees that you and your organization support their well-being.\n\nCli
 ck on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Request” butto
 n to automatically enroll.
