BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Triangleland": "https://triangleland.org/event/birding-with-wake-audubon-12"}
X-SOURCE-ID:triangleland
X-SOURCE:Triangle Land Conservancy
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261211T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261211T103000
DTSTAMP:20261023T165020Z
CREATED:20261023T164105Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T165020Z
UID:10000128-1796976000-1796985000@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Birding with Wake Audubon
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC and Wake Audubon for this wonderful birding walk!\nOur wonderful partners at Wake Audubon have joined TLC to lead a hike on the second Friday of each month at our Williamson Nature Preserve. Join this wonderful morning stroll and see what birds you can find.\n\nThis hike will be just under 2 miles around the Two Pond Loop at the preserve. Please wear good walking shoes and layers\, bring a water bottle\, and binoculars if you have them. We suggest that you leave your furry friends at home for this hike as they may scare away wildlife viewing opportunities. This is a free event\, but pre-registration is required.\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please fill out the waitlist form here by December 9th at noon.\n\n\n\nInclement Weather Policy: In the event of inclement weather\, you will be contacted by email for a call on cancellation or postponement.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/birding-with-wake-audubon-12
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
CATEGORIES:Birding,Hike
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
