 ountain on our Night Hike program. Mayo Mountain is an easy-moderate 2 mil
 e hike with heavy foliage.\n\nPlease bring hiking shoes\, flashlights\, wa
 ter\, and winter clothing. \nLeashed dogs are welcome.\n\nEvent is subject
  to cancel due to poor weather. Please click the "I'm Interested" button a
 s event will cancel when there are no registrations and recieve emails if 
 canceled due to weather.
