DESCRIPTION:Observe the Geminid Meteor shower at Medoc Mountain State Park.
  Medoc Mountain is dark sky certified making it a great place to watch for
  meteors. The Geminid meteor shower is one of the most reliebale and activ
 e meteor showers. During peak activity\, 75-100 meteors are expected per h
 our. The Geminid Meteor shower is active 12/4-12/20 and is projected to pe
 ak the night of December 13th\, 2026 after 9 PM. \n\nPlease come dressed f
 or the weather.\n\nEvent is subject to cancelation.
