DESCRIPTION:A holiday tradition like no other- Business After Hours at Nor
 th State Bank! Attendees can expect to be surrounded by beautiful holiday 
 decor that captures the essence of the season\, alongside a delightful arr
 ay of food that promises to satisfy every palate. North State Bank\, a lon
 g-standing member of our Chamber\, has consistently demonstrated their ded
 ication and involvement in our community. Their efforts to host this event
  each year are deeply appreciated\, making this gathering not only a chanc
 e to connect with fellow business leaders but also a celebration of the se
 ason's warmth and camaraderie. Come share in the joy and make lasting conn
 ections in a beautifully festive setting!
