DESCRIPTION:    <br>      <p><span>Durham Committee on the Affairs of Blac
 k People (DCABP) - Political Action Committee. We are consistently involv
 ed in voter education\, registration\, mobilization\, and recruitment of 
 qualified candidates in an effort to bring about the election of persons w
 ho are sensitive and responsive to the concerns of the Black community. DC
 ABP PAC also recruits and trains candidates to seek elected offices\, and 
 county boards and commissions. </span><span>This committee analyzes data 
 and develops activities to promote more expansive political community invo
 lvement.</span></p><p>DCABP PAC meets every 4th Tuesday of each month at 6
 :30PM. If you would like to know what is happening in the Durham political
  landscape and how it is impacting our Black community\, join us.</p><p><a
  href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.dcabp-pac.org/&amp\;sa=D&a
 mp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw28fAgQH8qBs3sR1Dm2fWsl" targ
 et="_blank">https://www.dcabp-pac.org/</a></p><p><span><u><a href="https:/
 /www.google.com/url?q=https://us02web.zoom.us/j/85668537561?pwd%3DV2JSeldK
 blNVbGo5YUNBVnhCazNEdz09&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;us
 g=AOvVaw3A2Isg3_77QBDuYUPz6UrJ" target="_blank">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/
 85668537561?pwd=V2JSeldKblNVbGo5YUNBVnhCazNEdz09</a></u></span>  <br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250418T190401Z
