DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Time to light up the Millpond!\n\n
 Come on out and celebrate the holidays at Merchants Millpond State Park an
 d see what festive lights the community has on display. The displays are i
 n a drive through style setup down our picnic area road that loops back ar
 ound to the exit. \n\nLights come on at 5:00 PM and will stay on until 8:0
 0 PM every Friday and Saturday from Nov 27th-Dec 19th. They will also be o
 n display Mon Dec 21st- Wed 23rd.\n\nDonations to Friends of Merchants Mil
 lpond are graciously accepted.
