  trail work scavenger hunt to complete while hiking 0.5 miles out onto Pro
 file Trail. Can you spot all the trail work pictured on your scavenger hun
 t? Check off all the boxes and get a First Day Hike sticker! This self-gui
 ded hike will be 1 mile total\, please dress appropriately for the weather
 . \n\n4198 N.C. 105 N.\nBanner Elk\, NC 28604\n\nhttps://www.stateparks.or
