DESCRIPTION:Join the park ranger for an easy 1.75-mile hike at the currentl
 y not-yet-open-to-the-public Salmon Creek State Natural Area. This is a un
 ique opportunity to preview one of our newest parks that is still under de
 velopment. Learn about the park's history and future while looking for bir
 ds and other wildlife. Dress for the weather. It is recommended that you s
 top by Bertie Beach at 243 Bal Gra Road for restroom facilities before com
 ing the Natural Area as there are none on-site yet.\n\nhttps://www.statepa
 rks.org/special-programs/first-day-hikes/
GEO:36.017392;-76.713777
LOCATION:Salmon Creek State Natural Area 
SUMMARY:First Day Hike at Salmon Creek State Natural Area
