BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_lgbtqcenterofdurham_org_qb71v8n48d0a304sq7dtm89f84
SUMMARY:Survivor Roots Support Group
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270114T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270114T190000
DTSTAMP:20261114T061542Z
UID:6o2nkojqc9sbqefgac9hrtdntb_R20261210T223000@google.com__20270114
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260527T220235Z
DESCRIPTION:This is a HYBRID support group that meets the 2nd &amp\; 4th T
 hursday\, folks can join in person or online. This group is available to a
 nyone who is:<br><ul><li>LGBTQIA+</li><li>a survivor of abuse (intimate pa
 rtner violence\, family violence\, or any other kind of relational abuse)<
 /li><li>North Carolina resident</li></ul><br>At the Southern Queer Survivo
 r Network\, we believe in the power of community-driven healing. A root of
  survivorship is community\, something many Queer and Trans people find th
 emselves without after surviving interpersonal violence. We are committed 
 to creating a space where healing isn’t just about individual recovery
 —it’s about liberation from the systems that harm us.<br><br>~ Survivo
 r Roots ~ an ongoing support group intended to support our community\, pro
 vide consistency\, build &amp\; deepen connections among LGBTQ+ survivors 
 of interpersonal violence. This is a space where survivors can reclaim the
 ir narratives\, strengthen their resilience\, and build solidarity with on
 e another.<br><br>The aim of this support group is to:<br><ul><li>Foster c
 ommunity among survivors</li><li>Cultivate feelings of safety\, connection
 \, and validation</li><li>Provide education about signs and cycles of Quee
 r IPV</li><li>Promote healing\, and when necessary\, provide referral to m
 ental health professionals</li></ul><br>Register at the link in our bio or
  here: <a target="_blank" href="http://bit.ly/SurvivorRoots">bit.ly/Surviv
 orRoots</a><br>Location and meeting links will be disclosed AFTER screenin
 g<br>Email <a target="_blank" href="mailto:advocate@lgbtqcenterofdurham.or
 g">advocate@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org</a> with any questions!
LAST-MODIFIED:20261112T235406Z
LOCATION:Disclosed after screening
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
