 /occurrences/FQIWhKTsi47oy_RhHBTUHxQQFDYUJBQeFAAAHBbAqtPUiGgAAA==</a><br><
 span><span>Join us on Thursday\, August 27th\, for the TFC Jet Ride!  Whee
 ls down at 6:15 pm.  A- &amp\; A+ groups only.<br><br>⚡ A+ Blazing Saddl
 es (21+ mph)<br>(29 mi) – DROP RIDE – hang tough or get left.<br><br>
 💨 A- No Chill Crew (19-20 mph)<br>(29 mi) – NO DROP – fast\, fierce
 \, and tight.<br><br>Both groups will meet in the parking lot behind Oak C
 ity Brewing at Knightdale Station Park. All rides will begin at Knightdale
  Station Park (810 N First Ave\, Knightdale). There are restrooms near thi
 s starting point.<br><br>29 Mile Route<br><br>Garmin: <a target="_blank" h
 ref="https://connect.garmin.com/modern/course/156383852">https://connect.g
 armin.com/modern/course/156383852</a> <br>RwGPS: <a target="_blank" href="
 https://ridewithgps.com/routes/50006326">https://ridewithgps.com/routes/50
