DTSTAMP:20261114T061623Z
UID:01osrf6chs0g33pfic4gvpapa5@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20270116
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20261009T010444Z
DESCRIPTION:The New Hope Bird Alliance and the Chapel Hill Bird Club are j
 oining together to offer all our members an MLK weekend choice of field tr
 ips\, <span><span>January 16-18\, 2027</span></span>. NHBA will be travel
 ing to the NC Outer Banks\, while CHBC will go to the Huntington Beach S
 tate Park in South Carolina.<b><i> The CHBC trip to Huntington Beach is fu
 ll\, wait list only.</i></b><br><br>Our expert trip leaders help you explo
 re the best birding hot spots in both venues. For the CHBC trip\, preferen
 ce will be given to members. Just send an email to David Anderson at <spa
 n><span><span><a href="mailto:d47anders@gmail.com" target="_blank">d47ande
 rs@gmail.com</a></span></span></span> for the Outer Banks\, or to Bo Howe
 s at <span><span><span><a href="mailto:bohowes@gmail.com" target="_blank"
 >bohowes@gmail.com</a></span></span></span> for Huntington Beach. We will
  sign you up\, and then send further details. Even with two trips\, space 
 is limited\, so respond as soon as you can. We are asking a donation of $7
 5 for either trip. <br><br>We are offering a couple of scholarships for s
 tudents or others who need help with funds for the trips. For questions\, 
 please contact David Anderson at <span><span><span><span><a href="mailto:
 d47anders@gmail.com" target="_blank">d47anders@gmail.com</a></span></span>
 </span></span> or Bo Howes at <span><span><span><a href="mailto:bohowes@
 gmail.com" target="_blank">bohowes@gmail.com</a></span></span></span>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T153934Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
