DESCRIPTION:Take a stroll on the beach with a park ranger to see what we ca
 n find.\n\nWe will be hunting for everything\, from drift beans to sea gla
 ss\, and of course\, seashells.\n\nSunscreen and water are recommended. Di
 stance of the hike will depend on the weather and the group. Meet at the F
 ort Visitor Center.\n\nPhoto by B. Hurst: Rock jetty on the inlet beach at
  Fort Macon State Park
