BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/introduction-to-qualtrics-714"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20261114T061632Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54418725712108
DTSTART:20270127T190000Z
DTEND:20270127T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Qualtrics is a powerful browser-based web-survey tool. It is av
 ailable to UNC Chapel Hill faculty\, staff\, and students\, for UNC-relate
 d projects. Qualtrics allows users to build complex surveys\, distribute t
 hem\, and analyze the responses all from one place.\n\n \n\nIn this course
 \, we will cover basic Qualtrics functions beginning with an overview of s
 urvey options and settings\, followed by hands-on practice programming and
  distributing a survey and downloading results. We will program some of th
 e most common question and response types\, customize requirements and val
 idation\, and add display logic\, skip logic\, and basic branch logic in t
 he “survey flow”. We will then create and upload a contact list and di
 scuss advantages and disadvantages of distributing the survey with a singl
 e reusable link vs. the survey mailer.  Finally\, we will cover a basic ov
 erview of the Data & Analysis tab for viewing\, editing\, and exporting ra
 w data into various formats including .csv\, .tsv\, .excel\, and .spss. Ot
 her topics include project sharing/ collaboration\, Groups and Libraries\,
  and preventing fraudulent responses and bot activity.\n\n \n\nThis is an 
 introductory course and will not cover the online analysis tools within Qu
 altrics. Please note\, this is a hands-on\, online course. All participant
 s are required to create a Qualtrics account before the course. Carolina f
 aculty\, staff and students may create their free Qualtrics account here t
 o access full features: http://qualtrics.unc.edu. Non-UNC affiliated parti
 cipants can create a free trial account here: https://www.qualtrics.com/\n
 \n \n\nRegistration and fee (refundable for UNCCH students upon attendance
 ) are required for Zoom link access. This event is sponsored by the UNC Od
 um Institute for Research in Social Science
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Introduction to Qualtrics
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/introduction-to-qualtrics-714
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
