DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Duke Arts Presents\n\nDocumentary filmmaker Sam Gre
 en returns to Duke with TREES\, an ambitious live cinema performance blend
 ing film\, live music\, and on-stage narration. With music by Caroline Sha
 w and text by Rebecca Solnit\, the work reflects humanity’s relationship
  with trees.
