 imately 1.5 mile hike. For beginning and advanced birders. Bring your bino
 culars\, or borrow a pair of ours. Pre-registration is required. Limited t
 o City of Raleigh residents.\n\nMEET IN THE NORTH parking lot at the end o
 f Camp Durant Road.
