UID:5b2r7grt02rrir0v2keur77mhp@google.com__20270205
SEQUENCE:3
CREATED:20251128T022957Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><p>Please join Democracy Support Group on Hillandale and
  Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Friday 3-4:00pm (unless it is raini
 ng) at Samuels Drive and Hillandale near Croasdaile in Durham.</p><p>Come 
 through the welcome entrance at Croasdaile\, 2600 Croasdaile Farm Parkway\
 , ask for directions to Samuels Drive and north parking lot and follow sig
 ns for EVENT PARKING.</p><p>Park anywhere in the north parking lot. We wal
 k out the gate on Samuels Drive.</p><p>Signs are available. Emphasis on po
 licies and not personalities.</p><p>This will be a POSITIVE and nonviolent
  demonstration. We are here to protect our democracy. We are standing up f
 or what we believe in. We want to inspire people to join us and grow our m
 ovement!</p><p>Please bring positive signs only. Some examples: Instead of
  "Stop defunding science" Say "Protect Research" "Immigrants make us stron
 ger" "Housing for all" "Healthcare for all" "Save the planet"</p><p>Make s
 igns about what you're standing up for -- whether that is the libraries\, 
 DEI\, healthcare\, women’s rights</p><p>Please no mocking signs\, no swa
 stikas</p><p>We are excited to see you there and stand together for our co
 untry!</p><p>See you every Friday engaging drivers in Durham.</p><p>Please
  join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="https://substack.com/profile/11
