DESCRIPTION:AI for Research (AIR): Driving Innovation Forward\n\n \n\nDisco
 ver how artificial intelligence can streamline workflows\, uncover hidden 
 patterns\, and empower breakthroughs in your field. Learn practical applic
 ations of AI through Odum Institute AIR series that can revolutionize your
  research process.\n\n \n\nAI\, for example ChatGPT\, may be used to const
 ruct code for software packages and programming languages commonly used by
  social scientists. Examples include SAS\, Stata and R. The quality of res
 ponses has varied to this point and may continue to at the time of the cla
 ss. Examples will be given.\n\n \n\nThis course is only open to those with
  an active UNC-Chapel Hill ONYEN. Registration and fee (refundable upon at
 tendance) are required for Zoom link access.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:AI for Research (AIR) - AI for Programming
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/ai-for-research-air-ai-for-pro
 gramming
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
