X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/ai-for-research-air-ai-and-simple-statistics"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20261114T061632Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54489420466496
DTSTART:20270216T180000Z
DTEND:20270216T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:AI for Research (AIR): Driving Innovation Forward\n\n \n\nDisco
 ver how artificial intelligence can streamline workflows\, uncover hidden 
 patterns\, and empower breakthroughs in your field. Learn practical applic
 ations of AI through Odum Institute AIR series that can revolutionize your
  research process.\n\n \n\nAI\, for example ChatGPT\, may be used to carry
  out some tasks commonly used by social scientists. Examples include Pears
 on’s chi-square test\, Fisher’s exact test\, Student’s t-test\, powe
 r calculations and non-centrality parameters. The quality of responses has
  varied to this point and may continue to at the time of the class. Exampl
 es will be given.\n\n \n\nThis course is only open to those with an active
  UNC Chapel Hill ONYEN. Registration and fee (refundable upon attendance) 
 are required for Zoom link access.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:AI for Research (AIR) - AI and Simple Statistics
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/ai-for-research-air-ai-and-sim
 ple-statistics
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
