X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/ai-for-research-air-introduction-to-ai-tools-in-qualitative-software"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20261114T061632Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54381184542483
DTSTART:20270224T150000Z
DTEND:20270224T163000Z
DESCRIPTION:Discover how artificial intelligence can streamline workflows\,
  uncover hidden patterns\, and empower breakthroughs in your field. Learn 
 practical applications of AI through Odum Institute AIR series that can re
 volutionize your research process.\n\nThis course will introduce participa
 nts to generative AI tools in qualitative software—ATLAS.ti\, MAXQDA\, a
 nd NVivo. These tools can be used to summarize textual documents through A
 I-assisted memo writing and to support coding\, with each program taking a
  different approach to integrating human judgment and AI features.\n\nThe 
 course will also demonstrate how ChatGPT can be used to code textual data\
 , how to create effective prompts\, and how to import results from ChatGPT
  into qualitative software for further analysis. The course will be based 
 on presentation and lecture but will provide brief exercises for hands-on 
 exercises to be completed outside of the course.\n\nRegistration and fee (
 refundable upon attendance of course) are required for Zoom link access. M
 ust have an active UNCCH Onyen to register.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:AI for Research (AIR) – Introduction to AI Tools in Qualitative S
 oftware
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/ai-for-research-air-introducti
 on-to-ai-tools-in-qualitative-software
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
