X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/conducting-qualitative-thematic-analysis-without-coding"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20261114T061632Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54230959272042
DTSTART:20270225T150000Z
DTEND:20270225T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Thematic analysis is a widely used and useful approach for anal
 yzing qualitative data\, but developing themes does not have to involve co
 ding. This workshop introduces alternative\, creative approaches to themat
 ic analysis that invite researchers to engage deeply with qualitative data
  through practices such as annotation\, close reading\, and poetic analysi
 s. Participants will explore how to identify patterns of meaning\, to atte
 nd to language and expression in data\, and to develop interpretive insigh
 ts without relying on a formal coding process. Through examples\, discussi
 on\, and hands-on activities\, participants will experiment with ways of e
 ngaging with their data\, including noticing resonances and tensions acros
 s data and using poetic techniques to explore and emphasize the meanings\,
  emotions\, and experiences expressed in qualitative materials.\n\n \n\nTh
 e workshop also considers how researchers make interpretive decisions\, mo
 ve from close engagement with individual accounts to broader patterns of m
 eaning\, and develop themes that remain grounded in the data. Emphasizing 
 curiosity\, reflexivity\, and interpretive creativity\, this workshop offe
 rs different pathways for researchers who want to expand their analytic pr
 actices beyond coding and to explore new ways of making meaning with quali
 tative data. Participants are encouraged to bring and use some of your own
  qualitative data\, or if you do not have data yet\, some will be supplied
 .\n\n \n\nRegistration and fee (refundable for UNCCH students) are require
 d. This event is sponsored by the UNC Odum Institue for Research.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Conducting Qualitative Thematic Analysis Without Coding
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/conducting-qualitative-themati
 c-analysis-without-coding
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
