BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/hidden-battleship-tour-6380"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20261114T061601Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53453711110868
DTSTART:20270227T160000Z
DTEND:20270227T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:Offered only four times this coming year\, Hidden Battleship ta
 kes adventurous visitors beyond the traditional self-guided tour and into 
 unrestored areas of the Battleship North Carolina Memorial that are normal
 ly closed to the public. Led by experienced guides in small groups\, parti
 cipants explore spaces deep below deck\, throughout the third deck\, in th
 e bow\, and high into the Ship's superstructure—including all the way to
  the top.\n\nThe 2027 Hidden Battleship tours will be offered on:\n\nSatur
 day\, February 27Saturday\, March 20Saturday\, April 24Saturday\, November
  20Each tour runs from 11:00 am to 5:00 pm. The cost is $75 per participan
 t\, plus tax.\n\nDesigned for adventurous history enthusiasts\, the six-ho
 ur experience requires climbing ladders\, crossing high hatches\, and navi
 gating tight and confined spaces. For that reason\, the program is limited
  to participants ages 16 and older.\n\n"Every compartment aboard the Battl
 eship has a story\," said Dr. Jay Martin\, Executive Director of Battleshi
 p North Carolina Memorial. "Hidden Battleship opens doors that are normall
 y closed\, inviting visitors to step into the spaces where sailors lived\,
  worked\, and fought—and to experience the Ship in a way very few people
  ever will."\n\nBecause attendance is intentionally limited to provide a s
 afe\, behind-the-scenes experience\, Hidden Battleship consistently sells 
 out well in advance. The experience has become a favorite among repeat vis
 itors\, military history enthusiasts\, photographers\, and anyone looking 
 to explore a side of the Ship that few ever have the opportunity to see.\n
 \nWhether you're searching for a memorable gift or your next great adventu
 re\, Hidden Battleship offers an unforgettable behind-the-scenes experienc
 e unlike any other.\n\nVisitors are encouraged to reserve their spots earl
 y. Tickets and additional information are available at https://bit.ly/hidd
 enbattleship
GEO:34.236158;-77.953643
LOCATION: Battleship North Carolina
SUMMARY:Hidden Battleship Tour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/hidden-battleship-tour-6380
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Guided Tours
CATEGORIES:Special Site Programs
END:VEVENT
