DESCRIPTION:Temple Theatre is one of North Carolina's premier regional thea
 tres\, offering Broadway-quality productions in the heart of downtown Sanf
 ord. \n\nExperience the heart and soul of America in Temple’s high-energ
 y patriotic musical revue that celebrates the nation’s heritage through 
 song\, dance\, and spirited storytelling. With a mix of humor\, history\, 
 and heart this revue is a foot-stomping-flag-waving celebration designed t
 o ignite pride in audiences of every generation.\n\nTickets range from $25
  to $40 with discounts available for active military\, Lee County educator
 s and students\, and groups of 10 or more. Visit templeshows.org or call 9
 19-774-4512 for more information.
