DTSTAMP:20261114T061632Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54301050392788
DTSTART:20270330T150000Z
DTEND:20270330T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Undergraduate and graduate Tar Heels\, your future starts here!
  Talk with admissions and recruitment reps\, get insider tips\, and plan y
 our next move at our Health Professions & Schools Information Fair 2027!\n
 \n \n\nRegistration is recommended but NOT required: https://unc.joinhands
 hake.com/career_fairs/760b9d0d-b477-46df-98af-8e4a16f9899b/student_preview
 \n\n \n\nHow to Prepare:\n\nItch to Pitch: Convey who you are\, what exper
 iences you have\, and what you're seeking in 30-60 seconds! Check out our 
 Linktree to find our Elevator Pitch Guide.\n\nDress to Impress: Wear profe
 ssional attire to show you’re serious and prepared!\n\nShow What You Kno
 w: Research the employers that are attending on Handshake so you can see w
 hat roles they are hiring for\, ask relevant questions\, and stand out.\n\
 nHand Away Your Resume: Print multiple copies of your resume so employers/
 schools can quite literally have it on file.\n\nThis event is sponsored by
  the UNC Career Center
GEO:35.905783;-79.046345
LOCATION:Ram's Head Recreation Center
SUMMARY:Health Professions & Schools Information Fair 2027
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/health-professions-schools-inf
 ormation-fair-2027
CATEGORIES:Meetings and Conferences
END:VEVENT
