UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54496510753855
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270403
DESCRIPTION:Explore North Carolina’s bottomland hardwood forest and exper
 ience a night in a remote swamp. We will camp on the Roanoke River Partner
 ’s platforms in the homes of beaver\, barred owls\, and migratory songbi
 rds. Go to sleep to the hootin’ and hollerin’ of barred owls and wake 
 to the sweet call of prothonotary warblers. Become familiar with one of No
 rth Carolina’s true wild areas and bring new ideas and activities back t
 o your students. The Museum has tents\, sleeping pads\, ground chairs\, an
 d a few sleeping bags to loan if you don’t have your own camping gear!\n
 \nCredit: 16 contact hours toward CEUs or Criteria II/III for North Caroli
 na’s Environmental Education Certification Program\n\nLodging: The works
 hop fee covers one night of platform camping in tents on the Roanoke River
  near Jamesville\, NC\n\nTransportation: Participants will ride with the g
 roup from Raleigh departing at 8am. Transportation will be in Museum vans 
 or bus.\n\nRegistration: This workshop is FULL\, please join our waiting l
 ist!\n\nThe full workshop fee is due when you register and payment is via 
 credit card. Registration for most Educator Treks is on a first-come\, fir
 st-served basis. Treks fill quickly\, so register early! If when you attem
 pt to register it is full\, please join our waiting list and we will notif
 y you as soon as possible if a space opens for you!\n\nNote: We do not wan
 t cost to be a barrier for any educator. If the cost of this workshop woul
 d prevent your participation\, please reach out to Megan Davis.\n\nDetails
 :\n\nFee: $115 (includes canoe rental\, camping platform fee\, most meals\
 , most camping gear)Requirements: For educators (includes teachers\, admin
 istrators\, pre-service or substitute teachers\; non-formal educators\; an
 y adult working on their EE certification)Program Instructor(s): Megan Dav
 is\, Rory McCollumActivity Level: Moderate
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences
SUMMARY:Sold Out: Educator Trek: Secrets of the Swamp
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/educator-trek-secrets-of-the
 -swamp
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Workshops & Trainings
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
CATEGORIES:Nature & Wildlife Programs
END:VEVENT
