DESCRIPTION:Explore the diverse stories of those who called North Carolina 
 home during the American Revolution in this compelling traveling exhibit. 
 People of Colonial North Carolina highlights the complex and often conflic
 ting paths different communities took in the fight for freedom and surviva
 l. Through maps\, rare documents\, and illustrations\, the exhibit offers 
 a look at how the American Revolution impacted everyday lives.
GEO:36.092774;-79.436435
LOCATION:May Memorial Library
SUMMARY:People of Colonial North Carolina Exhibit
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/people-of-colonial-north-car
 olina
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Exhibitions
